//! Normative DAB tables, transcribed from **ETSI EN 300 401 V2.1.1 (2017-01)**.
//!
//! Generated from the standard's own text extraction, not typed by hand — the
//! generator asserts each table's invariants before emitting (Table 13: PI n
//! keeps exactly 8+n of 32 bits; Table 23: the ranges tile [-768, -1] and
//! [1, 768] exactly once; Table 24: 4 x 32 values in 0..=3).
//!
//! Do not edit by hand. The same numbers were cross-checked against the MIT
//! reference `dabradio` 0.5.0 (`crates/dabradio/src/constants.rs` and
//! `eep.rs`, from `xoolive/desperado`), whose tables agree value-for-value;
//! the MIT notice for
//! that cross-check is recorded in `docs/protocol-dab.md`.

